{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the game</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hamster Hustle is a fast-paced, online multiplayer party game that supports up to 16 players per match. Built with a focus on player interaction and replayability, it offers a lighthearted blend of strategy, movement, and chaos\u2014perfect for game nights, streaming, and casual competition.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each round begins with one player randomly selected as \u201cit.\u201d The objective? Tag another player to pass it on and keep the highest score, because the longer you\u2019re tagged, the more your score drops. Use sprinting, pushing, and quick thinking to avoid becoming the next target. The player with the highest score wins the game. With a range of vibrant maps, customizable game modes, Hamster Hustle is designed to bring people together.  Hamster Hustle delivers quick, memorable rounds and a cozy visual style that invites players back for &quot;just one more game.&quot; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 16-player online multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tag-based gameplay with simple but strategic mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game skin customization, a wide variety of emotes, and flashy VFX</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of hand-crafted maps from spacious arenas to fast-paced close-quarters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to create meaningful, social, and memorable gameplay moments</p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597930?t=1754612805","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597930?t=1754612805","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597930/b8ee4a6137